								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3342.msg37568#msg37568">Re: the merit of Gansta Rap; when is it fruitless &amp; undeserving</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #30 on:</b> September 27, 2007, 12:20:48 am &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
